      "howCaught": "The controller local-verify-flake-rerun is registered with boundK 9 and perTargetBoundK 3, both derived from LOCAL_VERIFY_LIMITS (3 files per verify x 3 runs per import-related file). Edge: a lane that ends with 1 to 3 failed files re-runs them. Steady-state bound: the cap counts files and is spent once per verify, so at most 3 files are re-run and each at most 3 times. Settling brake: a file's first solo run that does not pass ends its sequence, and after a final failure in a lane a further import-related file gets one detail-only run. The budget lives inside one verify, so the count does not grow with the horizon."
